- Keep an outgoing Lightning attempt pending while its own native payment is pending.
  An xpay error no longer marks that unresolved payment failed.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
- Resume an intra-Ark receive after its sender already settled.
  A restart between the sender and receive commits no longer retries a cancelled
  external hold or repeats the sender's success notification.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
